summary: Test interoperability between keylime-policy and keylimectl policy commands
description: |
    Verifies that runtime policies created and signed by keylime-policy are usable
    with keylimectl and vice versa. Tests policy creation equivalence, cross-tool agent
    enrollment with policies from the other tool, cross-tool signature verification,
    and pushing keylime-policy-created policies to the verifier via keylimectl.
contact: ansasaki
component:
  - keylime
test: ./test.sh
framework: beakerlib
tag:
  - CI-Tier-2
  - compatibility
require:
  - keylime
  - expect
  - jq
  - openssl
duration: 15m
enabled: true
